# NEW Firebase / Firestore project for ArcadeX on Arc.
# Do NOT reuse live MiniPay / arcadex-celo Firebase credentials or databases.
#
# Create a fresh Firebase project, then fill these as Cloudflare Worker secrets
# (or .env.local for local next dev). Leave blank until provisioned.
#
# FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=
# FIREBASE_CLIENT_EMAIL=
# FIREBASE_PRIVATE_KEY=
# FIREBASE_DATABASE_URL=
#
# Game catalog may be copied forward from Celo (chain-agnostic).
# Player sparks / progress / payment guards must use the NEW Arc D1 — never the live MiniPay DB.
